{{Unobtainable}}
'''CPAC''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] introduced in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] and was part of the [[Pikotaro Collaboration Event]]. It was used as an incentive for players to share the campaign video 100,000 times. Once the campaign reached its goal, the unit would appear in the [[Upgrade Menu]] section for Special Cats between January 12, 2017 and January 31, 2017. Once the date has passed, the unit would be removed for anyone who failed to claim said unit.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 317
|rarity = EX
|name1 = CPAC
|name2 = PPAP
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''PPAP''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This is an overall weak [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] Cat that is easily outclassed by other cats of similar class that can inflict much more damage, like [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]] or [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Viking Cat]].

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

